# One total rule. This tree is read by git on Windows hosts AND inside Linux
# containers; any text file a per-extension list missed checks out CRLF on
# Windows and then reads as eternally modified from the container side. LF also
# keeps shebangs intact -- a CRLF entrypoint.sh fails as "no such file or
# directory" against a file that is plainly there. `auto` spares binaries.
* text=auto eol=lf
